Reference standards
-------------------
STKCraft implements published standards rather than any product's implementation:

- IERS Conventions (2010), IERS Technical Note No. 36, for the time scales, Earth
  orientation parameters and leap-second data.
- IAU resolutions and the IAU SOFA / ERFA reference implementations for fundamental
  astronomy constants and transformations. ERFA is distributed under a BSD-style license
  derived from SOFA with permission; STKCraft uses the published *values and algorithms*,
  not the library.
- The SGP4 specification (Vallado, Crawford, Hujsak and Kelso, AIAA 2006-6753) and its
  published verification vectors.
- CCSDS blue books for orbit and tracking data exchange formats (OEM, OPM, OMM).
